# Private Configuration Template

Copy this file to `config.local.md` and fill in your values.

**This file is gitignored - your actual values will not be committed.**

## NAS Access

| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| Hostname | `your-nas.local` |
| SSH User | `your-username` |
| SSH Password | (store in password manager) |
| Web UI | `http://your-nas.local:8080` |

## Domain & DNS

| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| Domain | `yourdomain.com` |
| Cloudflare Account | (your Cloudflare login) |
| Tunnel Name | `your-tunnel-name` |

## Network (arr-stack: 172.20.0.0/24)

| Service | IP Address |
|---------|------------|
| Gateway | 172.20.0.1 |
| Traefik | 172.20.0.2 |
| Jellyfin | 172.20.0.4 |
| Pi-hole | 172.20.0.5 |
| dnscrypt | 172.20.0.6 |
| Seerr | 172.20.0.8 |
| Bazarr | 172.20.0.9 |
| Sonarr | 172.20.0.10 |
| Radarr | 172.20.0.11 |
| Cloudflared | 172.20.0.12 |
| Uptime Kuma | 172.20.0.13 |
| duc | 172.20.0.14 |
| Beszel | 172.20.0.15 |
| DIUN | 172.20.0.16 |
| qBittorrent | 172.20.0.17 |
| SABnzbd | 172.20.0.18 |
| Prowlarr | 172.20.0.19 |
| Baserow (therapy-stack) | 172.20.0.20 |
| FlareSolverr | 172.20.0.21 |

## Service URLs

Replace `yourdomain.com` with your actual domain:

| Service | URL |
|---------|-----|
| Traefik Dashboard | https://traefik.yourdomain.com |
| Jellyfin | https://jellyfin.yourdomain.com |
| Seerr | https://seerr.yourdomain.com |
| Sonarr | https://sonarr.yourdomain.com |
| Radarr | https://radarr.yourdomain.com |
| Prowlarr | https://prowlarr.yourdomain.com |
| qBittorrent | https://qbit.yourdomain.com |
| Bazarr | https://bazarr.yourdomain.com |
| Pi-hole | https://pihole.yourdomain.com/admin |
| Uptime Kuma | https://uptime.yourdomain.com |

## Local Access (when on home network)

NAS LAN IP: `YOUR_NAS_LAN_IP` (or `your-nas.local`)

| Service | URL |
|---------|-----|
| NAS Web UI | http://your-nas.local:8080 |
| Jellyfin | http://your-nas.local:8096 |
| Sonarr | http://your-nas.local:8989 |
| Radarr | http://your-nas.local:7878 |
| Prowlarr | http://your-nas.local:9696 |
| qBittorrent | http://your-nas.local:8085 |

## Paths on NAS

| Path | Contents |
|------|----------|
| `/volume2/docker/arr-stack/` | Docker compose files and configs (SSD pool) |
| `/volume1/Media/Movies/` | Movie library |
| `/volume1/Media/Series/` | TV library |
| `/volume1/Media/torrents/` | qBittorrent downloads |
| `/volume1/Media/usenet/` | SABnzbd downloads |
